class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happens if I can\u2019t find all the kittens in a level?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry! You can take your time to find all the kittens because the game is designed to be relaxing and untimed, so there\u2019s no rush. If you need a break, your progress will be saved automatically, allowing you to pick up where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you\u2019re really stuck, you can use a hint, which is available once every two minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Should I play the Demo?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, because the demo has extra content. It has two unique levels and 220 cute little kittens to be found.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why do I hear kittens meowing sometimes while playing the game?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally as your mouse cursor hovers over a hidden kitten, she will meow to give you an idea of her location to help you in the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302600/extras/897c50b97b804532c5f74d3b48b4ebb8.avif?t=1750194031\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302600/extras/c19bf18c6eb7f8e4193e00467c4e00a3.avif?t=1750194031\" data-has-big width=800 height=77 /></span></p>",
